                    <li class="flex items-center text-gray-600"><span class="text-green-500 mr-2">✓</span> Travail collaboratif</li>
                    <li class="flex items-center text-gray-600"><span class="text-green-500 mr-2">✓</span> Stockage illimité</li>
                    <li class="flex items-center text-gray-600"><span class="text-green-500 mr-2">✓</span> Gestion multi-utilisateurs</li>
